  "version": 1,
  "about": "Shared test vectors of agent sign-in by device authorization. Generated; do not edit by hand. Each case gives a request, the exact RFC 9421 signature base, and the Signature-Input, Signature and Content-Digest a correct signer produces for it with the named key, clock and nonce.",
